<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ D.1 Extending to Other Models ‣ Appendix D Additional Results ‣ Rethinking Entropy Regularization in Large Reasoning Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> reports detailed results on five mathematical benchmarks. On Qwen2.5-Math-1.5B, <em id="A4.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">SIREN</em> achieves an average maj@k of 45.1 and avg@k of 37.0, outperforming naive baselines by +2.4 on average maj@k, respectively. On Llama3.1-8B, <em id="A4.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">SIREN</em> attains 10.5 maj@k and 8.7 avg@k, also surpassing all other baselines.</p>
</div>
</section>
