<span id="A6.SS2.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#595959;">Ground Truth:</span><span id="A6.SS2.p2.pic1.2.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 55</span></span>
