</span>
<span id="A6.SS2.p4.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p4.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This is not 2024, so the correct set <math id="A6.SS2.p4.pic1.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> must be <math id="A6.SS2.p4.pic1.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{11,10,9,8,7,6,3,1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">11</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">8</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">6</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{11,10,9,8,7,6,3,1\}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A6.SS2.p4.pic1.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1</annotation></semantics></math>. The sum of the elements of <math id="A6.SS2.p4.pic1.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> is 55. So, the final answer is:</span></span>
<span id="A6.Ex33" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{55}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">55</mn></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{55}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
